  "extract": "Michigan (  MISH-ig-ən) is a peninsular state in the Great Lakes and Upper Midwest regions of the United States. It shares water and land boundaries with Minnesota to the northwest, Wisconsin to the west, Indiana and Illinois to the southwest, Ohio to the southeast, and the Canadian province of Ontario to the east, northeast and north.",
